 "provenance": "Bavaria 3 (w1 l2) normal exit with the HOOK obtained in-stage, control-only on the exact S700 core. Start: lives 12 (campaign-style value used by earlier routes), weaponTier 1 (Bavaria seal grants the hammer), maxHealth 4. First 141 ticks re-play the intent of the old port attempt bavaria-03-two-checkpoints (brick barrier, checkpoint 12,3). Then: diamond field to 12,10; row 10 west and column 6 to checkpoint 11,14; shaft 13 to the plate; stone 4,21 pushed left to fill 3,24; hammer on grass 7,25 fills hole 7,27; hammer on grass 2,23 releases roller 1,23 which destroys crusher 10,25-26; stone 10,24 then pushed onto plate 13,27 (gate 0 stays open); HOOK chest 24,25 (weaponTier becomes 2); hook pulls stone 29,25; column 30 and row 20 to checkpoint 18,20; stone 15,20 pushed into the shaft; hook from marker 15,15 pulls stone 17,15; hook from 20,14 pulls roller 22,14, which falls beside crusher 22,16-17 and destroys it; exit 25,17. Diamond lock tile (24,17) is cleared at load in this S700 build. Repaired after the host was corrected to paint every frame like cGame.run (method_132): the original then shows the item dialogue when the chest opens, and the route dismisses it with the action key, keeping its other controls.",
